  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-110-jin067-xitan-xihui:murder" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-zizhitongjian-110-jin067-xitan-xihui:murder:m0000" ref="ebb_5a7_96e">恢</persName>請降。<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-110-jin067-xitan-xihui:murder:m0004" ref="7d6_693_498">佺期</persName>入府，斬<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-110-jin067-xitan-xihui:murder:m0010" ref="v7q_jib_stt">閭丘羨</persName>，放<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-110-jin067-xitan-xihui:murder:m0015" ref="ebb_5a7_96e">恢</persName>還都，至楊口，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-110-jin067-xitan-xihui:murder:m0023" ref="0f4_bf0_876">殷仲堪</persName>陰使人殺之，及其四子，託言群蠻所殺。</p>
